    {
      "text": "Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon can be spotted in wall paintings from as far back as 10,000 years ago. For a while, it was thought to have gone extinct.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It looks strong, and that’s exactly what it is. As the weather grows colder, its ice tusks grow longer, thicker, and more impressive.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "This species reached its zenith during the period known as the ice age. I suspect that Hisui's frigid climate is in harmony with Mamoswine's constitution, thus awakening hidden potential.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
